<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northwest Natural Gas.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northwest Natural Gas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch upgraded Northwest Natural Gas Co to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said kept Northwest's long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Separately, Northwest on Monday said it filed for a rate increase averaging about six percent for its customers in Washington.</p>
<p>-- Northwest gained 3/4 to 25-1/2.</p>
</text>
